## Shared files (extra caution)

These affect attendee **and** other surfaces. Editing them requires passcode **4778** if the change impacts attendee UI, fonts, colors, layout, nav, or artboard sizing — **even if the task mentions live stream**:

- `app/layout.tsx`, `app/globals.css`, `lib/routes.ts`, `lib/responsive.ts`

